{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vending Machine Co.</strong>, a cozy fiddly management and job simulator game where you grow a vending machine business across a Japanese-inspired city full of life, charm, and opportunity. Filled with a lot of minigames!</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622640/extras/c7c03dcc1e5c6e610a896cd827326712.poster.avif?t=1768360749\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622640/extras/c7c03dcc1e5c6e610a896cd827326712.webm?t=1768360749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622640/extras/c7c03dcc1e5c6e610a896cd827326712.mp4?t=1768360749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start small, with just a few machines and limited items. Choose your first neighborhood\u2014will you begin in the quiet streets of <i>Komorebi Homes</i> or the bustling pop culture paradise of <i>Otaku Alley</i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the city map and unlock new districts, each with unique residents and preferences. From tired salarymen in the business district to curious tourists near temple grounds, everyone needs a snack, drink, or quirky gadget\u2014and you\u2019re here to deliver!</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622640/extras/cc4dd0210e03dc8990f45c91f7cf1309.poster.avif?t=1768360749\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622640/extras/cc4dd0210e03dc8990f45c91f7cf1309.webm?t=1768360749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622640/extras/cc4dd0210e03dc8990f45c91f7cf1309.mp4?t=1768360749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\uddfe Explore and unlock neighborhoods with different buyer types   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Install and upgrade vending machines across pre-set city spots   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\uded2 Buy wholesale items like ramen, gachapon toys, green tea, and gadgets   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\udcb8 Set prices based on local demand and daily market trends   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\udce6 Add machine features like drink heaters, coolers, and QR payments   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83c\udfae Enjoy chill upgrades, cozy vibes, and satisfying sales flow   </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your empire grows, so will your catalog. Stock seasonal goods, keep up with trends, and make each machine a perfect match for its area. </p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622640/extras/71ee30b27edec6084a5caf5d0cf942ca.poster.avif?t=1768360749\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622640/extras/71ee30b27edec6084a5caf5d0cf942ca.webm?t=1768360749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622640/extras/71ee30b27edec6084a5caf5d0cf942ca.mp4?t=1768360749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re optimizing profits or just vibing with the ambient lo-fi and cicadas, <strong>Vending Machine Co.</strong> lets you build your business at your own pace with different game modes that fit your preference! </p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622640/extras/533b8ac377a14644f395b66f5379d098.avif?t=1768360749\" width=1560 height=460 /></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3622640?t=1768360749","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622640/61ddf6674f29bb85f4280d3405a1eebc00f96598/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768360749","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622640/fd29e1af14aa843ec803f5ed9e5b3ba09c645008/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768360749","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622640/fd29e1af14aa843ec803f5ed9e5b3ba09c645008/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768360749","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3737470,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Play the Demo First!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622640/extras/533b8ac377a14644f395b66f5379d098.avif?t=1768360749\" width=1560 height=460 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vending Machine Co.</strong>, a cozy fiddly management and job simulator game where you grow a vending machine business across a Japanese-inspired city full of life, charm, and opportunity. Filled with a lot of minigames!</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622640/extras/c7c03dcc1e5c6e610a896cd827326712.poster.avif?t=1768360749\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622640/extras/c7c03dcc1e5c6e610a896cd827326712.webm?t=1768360749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622640/extras/c7c03dcc1e5c6e610a896cd827326712.mp4?t=1768360749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start small, with just a few machines and limited items. Choose your first neighborhood\u2014will you begin in the quiet streets of <i>Komorebi Homes</i> or the bustling pop culture paradise of <i>Otaku Alley</i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the city map and unlock new districts, each with unique residents and preferences. From tired salarymen in the business district to curious tourists near temple grounds, everyone needs a snack, drink, or quirky gadget\u2014and you\u2019re here to deliver!</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622640/extras/cc4dd0210e03dc8990f45c91f7cf1309.poster.avif?t=1768360749\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622640/extras/cc4dd0210e03dc8990f45c91f7cf1309.webm?t=1768360749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622640/extras/cc4dd0210e03dc8990f45c91f7cf1309.mp4?t=1768360749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\uddfe Explore and unlock neighborhoods with different buyer types   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Install and upgrade vending machines across pre-set city spots   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\uded2 Buy wholesale items like ramen, gachapon toys, green tea, and gadgets   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\udcb8 Set prices based on local demand and daily market trends   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\udce6 Add machine features like drink heaters, coolers, and QR payments   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83c\udfae Enjoy chill upgrades, cozy vibes, and satisfying sales flow   </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your empire grows, so will your catalog. Stock seasonal goods, keep up with trends, and make each machine a perfect match for its area. </p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622640/extras/71ee30b27edec6084a5caf5d0cf942ca.poster.avif?t=1768360749\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622640/extras/71ee30b27edec6084a5caf5d0cf942ca.webm?t=1768360749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622640/extras/71ee30b27edec6084a5caf5d0cf942ca.mp4?t=1768360749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re optimizing profits or just vibing with the ambient lo-fi and cicadas, <strong>Vending Machine Co.</strong> lets you build your business at your own pace with different game modes that fit your preference! </p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622640/extras/533b8ac377a14644f395b66f5379d098.avif?t=1768360749\" width=1560 height=460 /></span>","developers":["Rogue Duck Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622640/d09fcbf7d29b01c8d1262c68fa76237cc63af496/header.jpg?t=1768360749"